<title>USA: Candlewood Hotel 3.9 mln IPO takes effect.</title>
<headline>Candlewood Hotel 3.9 mln IPO takes effect.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Candlelwood Hotel Co Inc said Thursday it began its initial public offering of 3,850,000 shares of common stock at $10 per share.</p>
<p>The issue was underwritten by Montgomery Securities and Schroder Wertheim.</p>
<p>Candlewood is a hotel company that targets extended-stay business travelers.</p>
<p>Candlewood's stock was trading at 9-7/8, off 1/8.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
